# WPF Interop

Coming soon — this page documents hosting Reactor components inside
WPF apps, parallel to the existing WinForms interop story: host
control, data flow, threading constraints, accessibility hooks. See
[the AI Author Skill](../../_pipeline/ai-author-skill.md) for the
planned surface.

Until then, [WinForms Interop](winforms-interop.md) is the closest
existing pattern and most of the design carries over.
